<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORE.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play score on the first day of the four-day Supersport Series, formerly Castle Cup, cricket match on Thursday.</p>
<p>In Cape Town: Boland 239 (P.Adams 4-68) v Western Province.</p>
